<p>Take care of your golem:</p><ul><li> If it is destroyed, you will take some time to reconstruct it (this takes 15 alchemist gems and 20 turns).</li><li> If it is alive but hurt, you will be able to repair it for 0 (takes 2 alchemist gems). Spellpower, alchemist gem and Golem Power talent all influence the healing done.</li></ul>